    "northStar": "The Personal Watch Ranking",
    "overview": "A compact editorial introduction leads into a practical, vertically ordered collection. Dark green neutrals and a muted sage accent make the first choice legible without overwhelming watch names, specifications, or prices.\n\nThe visual system is restrained and operational: clear position numbers, quiet metadata, and explicit reorder controls. This document refreshes the original design brief from the shipped implementation in src/index.css and src/App.tsx.",
